                <pb facs="0243" n="231" xml:id="pg231"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Annex 2]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Draft Proposed by the American and Italian
                        Delegations</hi></head>
                <p>Poland further agrees that the Permanent Court of International Justice to be
                    established by the League of Nations may take jurisdiction over claims of
                    infraction of these obligations, and that she will submit to the exercise of
                    this jurisdiction upon such conditions and under such procedure as, by general
                    regulations, the Court shall from time to time prescribe. It is further agreed
                    that any decision of the Court shall be final and shall have the same force and
                    effect as an award under Article 13 of the Covenant of the League of
                    Nations.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
